mpete with rival airlines in our turn-based airline strategy game, inspired by the classic SNES game Aerobiz Supersonic. Play the free demo on Steam for Windows, Linux and macOS: https://store.steampowered.com/app/5013740/ Which route did you open first? Share your feedback with us on Steam or Discord. The full game is planned to launch in Steam Early Access o","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T09:45:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114028230","verified_at":"2026-10-21T14:34:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5013740-1846018067939226","game_id":"steam-5013740","kind":"announcement","title":"Early Access launches November 12 — Roadmap revealed!","summary":"Cleared for takeoff! Your airline empire takes off on November 12, 2026! Launch into Early Access with Flight School and three historical scenarios, create your own Open Skies sandbox across 120+ cities, or challenge friends in local hot-seat multiplayer. Here’s your launch lineup—and our flight plan for the months ahead. What you can play at launch — November 12, 2026 Turn-based airline strategy: build your network, grow your fleet and outmaneuver rival airlines. Flight School + three historica","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-11T19:26:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067939226","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:19:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5013740-1844115010496761","game_id":"steam-5013740","kind":"announcement","title":"Updated public demo and live stream","summary":"Captain Ethan decided to show off Aviator: Airline Empire in a live stream, which is a particularly useful way to see the game. A polished screenshot can show a route. A live player shows the hesitation before opening it, the glance at the aircraft range, and the moment when the budget starts looking less generous than it did five minutes earlier.You can watch Captain Ethan’s live stream on YouTube September 21. The stream gives the demo room to behave like a game rather than a brochure: choices","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-19T07:30:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010496761","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:19:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5013740-1843481262688936","game_id":"steam-5013740","kind":"announcement","title":"Aviator: Airline Empire — Demo Landing Early September 10!","summary":"We originally planned to release the demo later, but… why wait?The public Steam demo launches September 10.Build your airline, create routes, expand your fleet, and compete from the dawn of the Jet Age onward.See you at the departure gate. 🛫Wishlist Aviator: Airline Empire on Steam and get ready for takeoff.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-09T12:50:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262688936","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:19:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5013740-1840944183784015","game_id":"steam-5013740","kind":"announcement","title":"Dev Log. Bending the Board: How Aviator Built Its Globe","summary":"A flat map is convenient for spreadsheets, but flight is inherently spherical.When you manage an airline, long-haul routes over the Pacific or across the Arctic sound straightforward in a timetable. On a standard rectangular board, however, those same routes require awkward cuts at the edges, stretched landmasses near the top, and polar regions that look less like ice caps and more like horizontal white fences.The natural answer is a 3D globe. The difficulty is that Aviator already had a visual ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-16T14:34:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183784015","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:19:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5013740-1840310314340088","game_id":"steam-5013740","kind":"announcement","title":"Beta Demo Release with Steam Next Fest","summary":"The runway lights are on This October, Aviator’s beta demo will take off during Steam Next Fest. It will be the first proper chance to get your hands on the controls, build an airline, open new routes, juggle aircraft, rivals, fuel, staff, reputation—and discover how quickly a respectable business plan can turn into beautifully organised turbulence. The demo is still being tuned, tested and occasionally threatened with a wrench. It will not contain everything planned for the full game, but it sh","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-05T19:56:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314340088","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:19:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5013740":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:14:34Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:14:34Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5013740":"2026-10-26T07:14:34Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5013740":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:14:34Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:14:34Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:14:34Z"},"5069300":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:14:34Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:14:34Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:14:34Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_i